codex
The first cap-audit attempt found that configuration IDs include construction provenance, so recreating an assignment with a new audit label changes its ID. It stopped before any metric was recorded. I’m fixing the replay to preserve each stored ID and exact assignment verbatim, then rerunning; this is an audit-adapter issue, not a physics failure.
